<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-ANYKSCHIU VYNAS 1996 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-ANYKSCHIU VYNAS 1996 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian wine producer and bottler Anykschiu Wine said on Tuesday its net profit rose to 13.4 million litas versus 7.2 million last year.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that its turnover was 60.4 million litas in 1996 versus 46.9 million a year before.</p>
<p>The company also reported its gross profit as 22.7 million litas and operating profit was 14.8 million litas last year.</p>
<p>The company said its 1996 year profit before taxes was 17.7 million litas.</p>
<p>Anykschiu Wine total assets totalled to 90.6 million litas in 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancus, Vilnius Newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
